#: ../GTIPTVPlayerPro/main.py:519 catalog_messages.py:1181
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{} v{}\n"
"Open-source IPTV player for Enigma2. Supports Xtream Codes accounts and Live "
"TV from standard local, mounted-network or HTTP(S) M3U playlists. Plain M3U "
"sources provide Live TV only.\n"
"\n"
"DEVELOPER\n"
"{}\n"
"\n"
"LEGAL NOTICE\n"
"This plugin does not provide channels, streams, accounts or playlists. The "
"user is responsible for using only content for which they have access and "
"usage rights.\n"
"\n"
"PRIVACY\n"
"When Open-Meteo is enabled, the selected city and location are sent to Open-"
"Meteo for the weather forecast. When TMDb is enabled, the movie/series title "
"and the TMDb key or token entered by the user are sent to TMDb. The IPTV "
"username and password are not sent to these services."
msgstr ""
"{} v{}\n"
"Iepenboarne-IPTV-spiler foar Enigma2. Stipet Xtream Codes-akkounts en Live "
"TV fan standert lokale, keppele netwurk- of HTTP(S) M3U-ôfspyllisten. "
"Gewoane M3U-boarnen biede allinnich Live TV.\n"
"\n"
"ÛNTWIKKELDER\n"
"{}\n"
"\n"
"JURIDYSKE MEIDIELING\n"
"Dizze ynstekker leveret gjin kanalen, streamen, akkounts of ôfspyllisten. De "
"brûker is ferantwurdlik foar it brûken fan allinnich ynhâld dêr't dy "
"tagongs- en gebrûksrjochten foar hat.\n"
"\n"
"PRIVACY\n"
"As Open-Meteo ynskeakele is, wurde it selektearre plak en de lokaasje foar "
"de waarferwachting nei Open-Meteo stjoerd. As TMDb ynskeakele is, wurde de "
"titel fan de film of searje en de troch de brûker ynfierde TMDb-kaai of "
"token nei TMDb stjoerd. De IPTV-brûkersnamme en it wachtwurd wurde net nei "
"dizze tsjinsten stjoerd."

